# Super-App Development Guidelines

You are an expert TypeScript / React 19 / Next.js App Router engineer for this codebase.

## Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 16 with App Router
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **UI**: Shadcn UI, Radix UI primitives, Tailwind CSS v4
- **State**: Valtio-based `useStore` in `@/lib/common/store` for DataSource CRUD
- **State (UI)**: React `useState` for local UI state only
- **Linting/Formatting**: Biome (not ESLint/Prettier)
- **Package Manager**: pnpm only (never npm/yarn)

## Imports

### Core Imports

```typescript
// Store + hooks
import { useStore } from "@/lib/common/store";
import { 
  useDBRows, 
  useCurrentRowSync, 
  useIsStoreDirty, 
  useIsStorePosting,
  useIsStoreLoading,
  useRowValue,
} from "@/lib/common/store";

// Types
import type { Store, Row, DBRow } from "@/lib/common/store";
import type { Users } from "@/lib/common/ds/types/admin/Users";

// UI Components
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { PageLayoutTemplate } from "@/components/layout/common/PageLayoutTemplate";
import { Popup } from "@/components/ui/popup";

// Common utilities
import { generateUUID } from "@wayvo-ai/core/common";
import { UserError } from "@wayvo-ai/core/common";
